WEBVTT

00:04:57.137 --> 00:05:01.980
Fast-forward to 2015,
it's a little over $14,000.

00:05:02.541 --> 00:05:06.905
The poverty levels decreased
[from] 84% from 1980

00:05:06.929 --> 00:05:09.737
to 10% in 2013.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.903
The unemployment rate is at 4.1%,

00:05:13.927 --> 00:05:17.712
slightly below 4.9% of that in the US.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.350
Let's talk security.

00:05:20.952 --> 00:05:24.376
I started traveling in Colombia
in 2010, and people were saying,

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.388
"Are you scared? Are you nervous?"

00:05:26.815 --> 00:05:29.635
And that's because,
10 to 15 years earlier,

00:05:29.659 --> 00:05:34.539
the drug lords and the drug cartel
would kidnap and torture people.